<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Comprehensive Parameters Guide — AquaGuard</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Master index and overview of all 21 physical, chemical, and biological water quality parameters in AquaGuard.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/global.css">
  <style>
    .param-page { padding: calc(var(--nav-h) + 2.5rem) 1.5rem 5rem; min-height: 100vh; }
    .param-container { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .param-card {
      background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--r-lg);
      padding: 2.5rem; box-shadow: var(--shadow); position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    }
    .param-card::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 3px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), var(--green), var(--purple)); }
    .param-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 1.25rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
    .p-item {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--r);
      padding: 1.25rem; transition: var(--t); text-decoration: none; display: block;
    }
    .p-item:hover { border-color: var(--accent); transform: translateY(-3px); background: rgba(0,242,254,0.04); }
    .p-title { font-weight: 700; color: var(--white); font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
    .p-desc { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.5; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<nav class="navbar scrolled" id="navbar">
  <a href="/fwater" class="nav-brand"><div class="nav-logo">💧</div><span class="nav-name">Aqua<span>Guard</span></span></a>
  <ul class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
    <li class="nav-dd"><button>Data Entry</button><div class="dd-menu"><a href="/physical">🧪 Physical</a><a href="/chemical">⚗️ Chemical</a><a href="/biological">🦠 Biological</a><a href="/environmental">🌿 Environmental</a><a href="/air">💨 Air Quality</a></div></li>
    <li class="nav-dd"><a href="#">WQI</a><div class="dd-menu"><a href="/w6swqi">Simple WQI</a><a href="/w4nsfwqi">NSF-WQI</a><a href="/w5wawqi">WA-WQI</a><a href="/w1ccmewqi">CCME-WQI</a></div></li>
    <li><a href="/treatment">Treatment</a></li><li><a href="/AQI">AQI</a></li><li><a href="/parameters" style="color:var(--accent)">Parameters</a></li><li><a href="/information">Data Info</a></li>
  </ul>
  <button class="nav-toggle" onclick="document.getElementById('navLinks').classList.toggle('open')"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
</nav>

<div class="param-page">
  <div class="param-container">
    <div class="param-card fu">
      <span class="badge badge-cyan">Comprehensive Index</span>
      <h1 style="font-size:2.2rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--white);margin-top:0.5rem">Master Water Parameters Matrix</h1>
      <p style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:0.5rem">Select any parameter below to inspect detailed chemistry, environmental impacts, WHO/EPA standard limits, and measurement technologies.</p>

      <div class="param-grid">
        <a href="/p1ammonia" class="p-item"><div class="p-title">1. Ammonia & Ammonium</div><div class="p-desc">NH₃ / NH₄⁺ nutrient & aquatic toxicity limits</div></a>
        <a href="/p2bod" class="p-item"><div class="p-title">2. BOD (Biochemical Demand)</div><div class="p-desc">Organic oxygen consumption over 5 days at 20°C</div></a>
        <a href="/p3algae" class="p-item"><div class="p-title">3. Blue-Green Algae</div><div class="p-desc">Cyanobacteria & microcystin toxin dynamics</div></a>
        <a href="/p4cdom" class="p-item"><div class="p-title">4. CDOM & fDOM</div><div class="p-desc">Dissolved organic matter UV/fluorescence tracking</div></a>
        <a href="/p5chloride" class="p-item"><div class="p-title">5. Chloride (Cl⁻)</div><div class="p-desc">Inorganic anion, salinity & de-icing salt runoff</div></a>
        <a href="/p6chlorophyll" class="p-item"><div class="p-title">6. Chlorophyll-a</div><div class="p-desc">Primary phytoplankton biomass & trophic indicator</div></a>
        <a href="/p7conductivity" class="p-item"><div class="p-title">7. Electrical Conductivity</div><div class="p-desc">Specific conductance & dissolved ion concentration</div></a>
        <a href="/p8cyanide" class="p-item"><div class="p-title">8. Cyanide (CN⁻)</div><div class="p-desc">Extremely toxic industrial anion & cellular poison</div></a>
        <a href="/p9depth" class="p-item"><div class="p-title">9. Water Depth</div><div class="p-desc">Hydrostatic pressure & depth-profiling sensors</div></a>
        <a href="/p10do" class="p-item"><div class="p-title">10. Dissolved Oxygen (DO)</div><div class="p-desc">Essential dissolved O₂ for aquatic ecosystem survival</div></a>
        <a href="/p11lsp" class="p-item"><div class="p-title">11. LTC Multi-Sensor</div><div class="p-desc">Level, Temperature & Conductivity logging suites</div></a>
        <a href="/p12nitrate" class="p-item"><div class="p-title">12. Nitrate (NO₃⁻)</div><div class="p-desc">Agricultural fertilizer nutrient & blue baby syndrome</div></a>
        <a href="/p13or" class="p-item"><div class="p-title">13. Oil & Grease</div><div class="p-desc">Petroleum hydrocarbons & film re-aeration inhibition</div></a>
        <a href="/p14ph" class="p-item"><div class="p-title">14. pH Scale</div><div class="p-desc">Fundamental hydrogen ion activity (-log[H⁺])</div></a>
        <a href="/p15phosphorus" class="p-item"><div class="p-title">15. Total Phosphorus</div><div class="p-desc">Primary limiting freshwater nutrient & eutrophication</div></a>
        <a href="/p16rhodamine" class="p-item"><div class="p-title">16. Rhodamine WT</div><div class="p-desc">Fluorescent dye for stream transport & time-of-travel</div></a>
        <a href="/p17temp" class="p-item"><div class="p-title">17. Water Temperature</div><div class="p-desc">Physical master parameter & thermal discharge limits</div></a>
        <a href="/p18toc" class="p-item"><div class="p-title">18. Total Organic Carbon</div><div class="p-desc">Quantitative organic molecules via HTCO combustion</div></a>
        <a href="/p19turbidity" class="p-item"><div class="p-title">19. Turbidity (NTU)</div><div class="p-desc">Suspended solids & nephelometric 90° light scattering</div></a>
        <a href="/p20waterlevel" class="p-item"><div class="p-title">20. Water Level & Stage</div><div class="p-desc">Surface stage height & flood early warning telemetry</div></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<footer class="footer"><p>© 2025 <strong>AquaGuard</strong> — Water Quality Parameter Guide</p></footer>
<script>window.addEventListener('scroll', () => document.getElementById('navbar').classList.toggle('scrolled', window.scrollY > 10));</script>
</body>
</html>